[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u56db\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_caveentrance",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Clear \\ Visibility: 14 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mt. Terrat tunnel",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be safe after we enter this tunnel. At the other end of this tunnel is Mt. Mortica, which won't have very many bounty hunters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for that Skadi... I used to scoff at those rumors that described her as a living avalanche. Turns out, I learned the truth today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was expecting her to be a bit stronger than your average shmuck, but those rumors turned out to not be exaggerated after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder why the guys at the bar always looked at me like I'm crazy when I laughed at them for being terrified of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now it's my turn to be terrified, hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true! I heard those same rumors going around in Rhodes Island too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've also never been sent on a mission with her before. I knew that she was really powerful, but I never expected this to happen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't even know that she was a bounty hunter before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's one of the most infamous bounty hunters out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that she's also after the treasure, we're going to have our work cut out for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no idea if the two of us will be able to beat her to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the case, does that mean my village...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. I think she'll drive the rest of the bounty hunters away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though... she might destroy a few villages in the process.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think she's here for the treasure. I can't let something like that happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, your Rhodes Island or whatever, will hire just about anyone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No Rhodes Island operator would ever harm others recklessly for their own selfish gain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Well, you seem nice enough, and even did me a favor. However, the fact that your Rhodes Island is enabling Skadi, an entity who knows only destruction, makes me question whether your organization truly seeks to help the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, as someone stricken with Oripathy, I've never seen Rhodes Island do anything to help those like me. We're still abused wherever we go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Big Bob...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What, got nothing to say to that? Honestly, I have no idea why you have so much faith in an organization like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "As far as I can tell, their claim of wanting to help the Infected is just lip service. In the end, all they see is money.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, what's the deal with Rhodes Island anyway? In this world, there's nothing that speaks louder than the coins in my hand!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you apologizing for? You're still a kid, and you still can't tell between ideals and reality, nor do you know your worth. But all of this is perfectly normal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's not what I meant. I know that I'm still lacking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that... whether as a police officer, or as an operator, I've met a lot of Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I wasn't able to save them all, because I was lacking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island is the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, they're useless? Hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. When the Infected were slaving away underground, locked away in remote places, or being killed for no reason, where was Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even when we try our hardest, we sometimes still come up short. That's true for both me and for Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Despite that, I'll never give up on any innocent Infected who I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island is the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Big Bob...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I told you, you're just a kid. What good does it do to hammer you with my grievances?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that Skadi, your coworker, would not hesitate to point her weapon at you, or abduct Carol to seize the treasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you say with confidence that someone like that would share your ideals and work with you to help the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what Skadi plans on doing, so I can't answer that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I trust that if Rhodes Island took her in, then she must have her reasons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can forget my rambling then. I overstepped my bounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, our priority right now is to help Miss Carol find the treasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just dead weight now, with this injured leg. Heh, I never thought I'd be the one burdening two little girls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Big Bob, we'll only consider you a burden on one condition...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and that's if you don't plan on sharing the treasure with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Hahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Bob, I wasn't disgusted by your condition. It's just that... I was a bit scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm from the sticks, and I haven't seen many Infected people. But even I can tell... that you've endured a lot of hardship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize if I was rude to you before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Heh, as long as we find the treasure and you get me my share, I'll be a happy camper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm... The treasure is important to our village, but we only need enough to resolve our problems. Mister Bob, you'll be able to get your fair share.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why Grani and I need help, and will aid you as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, Grani?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. In any case, we need to get moving soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our next destination should be Mt. Mortica. That mountain was named after some knight who died long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "If my intuition is correct, then that should be where the treasure is located, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "However, there are a lot of caves up ahead. It'd take an average person weeks to search them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. That's why we can't do this without you. There's no way we're going to hand you to that red-eyed woman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Please lead the way then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like a plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's some movement near the tunnel's exit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
